key: CORE-123
format: jira

Trim spaces in user names

Problem
User names keep leading and trailing spaces, so "bob " and "bob" are two users.
See the report (https://example.com/r/1) and https://example.com/r/2.

1. Sign up as " bob"
2. Sign in as "bob"

    String name = input; // List<String> stays

Input | Stored
" bob " | " bob "

Notes
Ask @user before releasing.

Acceptance criteria:
- Names are trimmed on sign-up and sign-in
- Existing names are left alone
